From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:21:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: apple: isp: offer macOS's local thumbnail raw
 buffers on T8132

Right after the local raw buffers, macOS enables the ISP-local raw
buffers of the front end's thumbnail on this camera,
LOCAL_FEP_THUMBNAIL_RAW_BUFFER_ENABLE (0x0169); the driver leaves them
off. What reads them is not known. The front-end statistics behind auto
exposure are among the candidates, and with them the low-light magenta
cast of this camera.

Add macos_fep_thumb to enable them before the preview stream, as macOS
does. It is off by default until a dark-room test shows its effect.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.h |  1 +
 2 files changed, 29 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c
index 49dd07e3db..609bcbe2cd 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cam.c
@@ -1323,6 +1323,32 @@ static void isp_ch_macos_hr(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 ch)
 		dev_warn_once(isp->dev, "highlight recovery refused: %d\n", err);
 }
 
+/*
+ * Right after the local raw buffers, macOS also enables the ISP-local raw
+ * buffers of the front end's thumbnail (LOCAL_FEP_THUMBNAIL_RAW_BUFFER_ENABLE,
+ * 0x0169); the driver leaves them off. What reads them is not known, the
+ * front-end statistics behind auto exposure among the candidates, so
+ * macos_fep_thumb offers them for tests (default: off).
+ */
+static bool macos_fep_thumb;
+module_param(macos_fep_thumb, bool, 0644);
+MODULE_PARM_DESC(macos_fep_thumb,
+		 "Enable the local FEP thumbnail raw buffers as macOS does (default: off)");
+
+static void isp_ch_macos_fep_thumb(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 ch)
+{
+	int err;
+
+	if (!READ_ONCE(macos_fep_thumb) || !isp->hw->macos_session_settings)
+		return;
+	err = isp_cmd_ch_u32_set(isp,
+				 CISP_CMD_CH_LOCAL_FEP_THUMBNAIL_RAW_BUFFER_ENABLE,
+				 ch, 1);
+	if (err)
+		dev_warn_once(isp->dev, "FEP thumbnail raw buffers refused: %d\n",
+			      err);
+}
+
 /*
  * A floor on the auto exposure gain (1/256 steps, as AE_GAIN_CAP_SET), for
  * tests: with it a lit scene is taken at the sensor gain of a dark room,
@@ -1840,6 +1866,8 @@ static int isp_ch_configure_capture(struct apple_isp *isp, u32 ch)
 			return err;
 	}
 
+	isp_ch_macos_fep_thumb(isp, ch);
+
 	err = isp_cmd_ch_preview_stream_set(isp, ch, 1);
 	if (err)
 		return err;
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.h b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.h
index 51249cd1c6..c21172c654 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.h
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/apple/isp/isp-cmd.h
@@ -48,6 +48,7 @@
 #define CISP_CMD_CH_BUFFER_POOL_RETURN			     0x015b
 #define CISP_CMD_CH_CAMERA_AGILE_FREQ_ARRAY_CURRENT_GET	     0x015e
 #define CISP_CMD_CH_CAR_ENABLE				     0x0164
+#define CISP_CMD_CH_LOCAL_FEP_THUMBNAIL_RAW_BUFFER_ENABLE    0x0169
 #define CISP_CMD_CH_AE_START				     0x0200
 #define CISP_CMD_CH_AE_STOP				     0x0201
 #define CISP_CMD_CH_AE_BIAS_EXPOSURE_SET		     0x0204
-- 
